 | L43 | **Setup's providers through agentosd (P2-2w c4e; CRED-5, CAP-9, ONB-3).** `AgentosdSetup.Providers`, `ConnectAPIKey` and `SetPrivateOK` call `page_setup_providers`, `page_setup_api_key` and `page_setup_private_ok`, which agentosd passes to the vault process (egress K23). A list that fails lists none, so the AI step offers nothing and setup does not finish. The key is a call argument only; `localapi.APIKey` prints as `[provider API key]`. `StartDeviceCode` still answers not served, and providers report no device code until c4e2, so the page offers no plan sign-in. The private-data box is still ticked by default (out of scope here; CAP-9 says default no for plans and hosted models). | CRED-5, CAP-9, ONB-3, CRED-1, L28 | `cmd/agentosd/setup.go`, `localsrv/setupproviders.go`. |
